OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy but dry with clear
OL,7,Fspells mostly in the north. The night
OL,8,Fwill continue dry with clear spells
OL,9,Fsoon spreading south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA mostly dry day with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells but cloudy with
OL,13,Fthe odd shower at times in the evening
OL,14,Falong the north coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FBright spells and occasional showers
OL,18,FThursday. Cloudy, a few showers north
OL,19,FFriday. Dry, sunny spells at first but
OL,20,Fcloud and rain spread east later
OL,21,FSaturday.
